  "description": "EYASIJ crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group C 2/c. Reported CIF formula moiety: C64 H64 N12 O16 Tb4,4(C1 H4 O1). From the CIF bond table, Tb2 (Tb) has 6 O neighbors; Tb1 (Tb) has 6 O neighbors; Tb3 (Tb) has 6 O neighbors; Tb4 (Tb) has 6 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 4 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.850-3.879 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 107.86-114.91°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C68H80N12O20Tb4.",
